/-!
# Exact time headroom for visible pair-Duhamel regeneration

One actual whole-restart receipt already supplies every parameter in its
causal Duhamel payment: the output frequency, physical duration, heat kernel
and nonlinear negative-one row.  Retaining the exact heat-kernel factor gives
the source-owned rate payment

```text
((2ν)⁻¹ (1 - exp (-2ν λₖ Δt))) / Δt · ‖N⁻¹ₖ‖².
```

Unlike the coarser frequency-weighted bound, this row is spatially summable
for every actual receipt without a caller-supplied summability certificate.
The visible aggregate of the complete input-pair table is paid by this exact
row.  Cancellation in the pair-aggregation kernel remains on the typed pair
carrier and is transported componentwise by the existing native path process.
-/

